WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.385
Danny: I don't understand.

2
00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:15.806
What happened to the nano-putty?

3
00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.829
Brad: I think the spider ate it.

4
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.391
Chuck: What are we going to do now?

5
00:00:21.392 --> 00:00:23.243
Bello: The answer is simple.

6
00:00:23.244 --> 00:00:27.121
We need more nano-putty. Right, Brad?

7
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:29.699
Brad: There's more nano-putty in my garage.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.231
We have to get back there.

9
00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:34.543
Dave: How are we going to do that?

10
00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:39.211
Chuck: We're so small that it would take forever to walk!

11
00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:43.884
Tina: When Bello and I were looking for the shrink-gun, we saw my wagon.

12
00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:45.524
Danny: Is it close?

13
00:00:45.525 --> 00:00:48.468
Bello: Yup, it's where we just were.

14
00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:52.429
Tina: We saw my neighbor, Mrs. Rice, looking at the wagon.

15
00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:56.555
Tina: I hope she doesn't decide to take it anywhere.

16
00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.599
Danny: If she does, we could get a ride!

17
00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.907
Brad: Well, what are we waiting for?

18
00:01:02.908 --> 00:01:05.385
Dave: Yeah. Lead the way, Tina.

19
00:01:05.386 --> 00:01:15.767
Tina: This way.

20
00:01:15.768 --> 00:01:17.866
Chuck: Wow!

21
00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:20.238
Dave: That's a really big wheel.

22
00:01:20.239 --> 00:01:22.679
Tina: How are we going to get in it?

23
00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:31.364
Bello: I'm sure we can find a way.

24
00:01:31.365 --> 00:01:33.830
Danny: That was close!

25
00:01:33.831 --> 00:01:39.919
Bello: Everybody be careful. Stay together.

26
00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.276
Tina: That was gross.

27
00:01:43.277 --> 00:01:45.847
Mrs. Rice: This is very strange.

28
00:01:45.848 --> 00:01:48.995
Where did Tina and her sculpture go?

29
00:01:48.996 --> 00:01:52.483
Mrs. Rice: Tina couldn't possibly carry it by herself.

30
00:01:52.484 --> 00:01:56.253
Mrs. Rice: I think Mr. Smith is too easily fooled.

31
00:01:56.254 --> 00:01:58.748
What if there really is a giant?

32
00:01:58.749 --> 00:02:02.224
Mrs. Rice: Oh no, I hope it hasn't hurt poor Tina!

33
00:02:02.225 --> 00:02:06.281
Mrs. Rice: I better take this wagon back to Tina's house.

34
00:02:06.282 --> 00:02:07.745
Tina: Did you hear that?

35
00:02:07.746 --> 00:02:11.184
Bello: She's going to take the wagon back to Tina's house.

36
00:02:11.185 --> 00:02:12.976
Brad: My place is on the way.

37
00:02:12.977 --> 00:02:15.545
She'll go right past my house!

38
00:02:15.546 --> 00:02:18.613
Danny: We have to get on board somehow.

39
00:02:18.614 --> 00:02:20.785
Dave: Let me try.

40
00:02:20.786 --> 00:02:28.362
Chuck: Okay, one . . . two . . . three!

41
00:02:28.363 --> 00:02:31.362
Dave: There's no good place to hang on to.

42
00:02:31.363 --> 00:02:33.200
Brad: I've got an idea.

43
00:02:33.201 --> 00:02:41.519
Everybody grab some gum.

44
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:44.386
Bello: Okay, what next, Brad?

45
00:02:44.387 --> 00:02:46.153
Brad: Well, it's simple.

46
00:02:46.154 --> 00:02:52.724
Brad: We just use the gum to stick our hands to the wheel and climb up.

47
00:02:52.725 --> 00:03:03.220
Danny: Well, we better hurry!

48
00:03:03.221 --> 00:03:09.157
Tina: Quick, everybody follow Danny.

49
00:03:09.158 --> 00:03:19.477
Chuck: It's speeding up.

50
00:03:19.478 --> 00:03:27.324
Tina: Hurry up, Bello!

51
00:03:27.325 --> 00:03:32.847
Danny & Dave: You made it!

52
00:03:32.848 --> 00:03:38.387
Bello: We're on our way!
